# Downloaded model weights — re-fetched automatically from Hugging Face/Roboflow at first run
# (see App/inference.py), so they don't need to live in the repo. local_model.pt (App/Models/*/*.pt
# already covers it) is a bit different -- reproducibly retrained via App/train_local_model.py --
# but its paired metadata.json is ignored too so the two never go out of sync in git.
App/Models/*/*.pt
App/Models/*/*.onnx
App/Models/*/local_model_metadata.json
App/Models/*/.cache/
App/Models/*/*/.cache/
App/Models/Bone/hf_cache/

# offline_cv.py's generated reference templates — deterministically rebuilt from the datasets
# already in Models/*/Data Set/ on first use, no need to commit the derived output.
App/Models/*/templates/

# Local runtime artifacts
radiology_cache.db
pink_edge_cache.db
App/Validation/validation_test_cache.db
App/Misc/Pink_Edge_AI-main/Pink_Edge_AI-main/pink_edge_cache.db

# Secrets — never commit these. Use Streamlit Cloud's Secrets manager or a local untracked file.
roboflow_key.txt
App/.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Apk/ — Buildozer's own build cache/output (SDK/NDK downloads, compiled APKs) and the template
# PNGs generate_assets.py derives from App/Models/*/Data Set/ (same "derived, don't commit" reasoning
# as App/Models/*/templates/ above).
Apk/.buildozer/
Apk/bin/
Apk/assets/*/positive.png
Apk/assets/*/negative.png
Apk/reports/
Apk/_last_overlay.png

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# Local tool config — not part of the project itself
.claude/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
